<title>CANADA: Teck Corp Q3 net jumps after gain.</title>
<headline>Teck Corp Q3 net jumps after gain.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.21		   C$0.24</p>
<p> Net			212,357		   22,638</p>
<p> Revs		     183,356		  187,526</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.63		   C$0.68</p>
<p> Net			252,906		   62,217</p>
<p> Revs		     549,787		  522,220</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  96,239		   91,757</p>
<p>(All data above 0000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Q3 includes gain of C$352.6 million before deferred taxes of C$120.2 million on acquisition of company's stake in Diamond Fields Resources Inc by Inco Ltd for cash and securities with estimated value of C$461 million.</p>
<p>Q3 includes property valuation writedowns of C$16.1 million after tax, investment valuation writedown of C$7.0 million after tax and &quot;other&quot; writedowns of C$7.5 million after tax.</p>
<p>Q3 earnings excluding unusual items were C$11 million or C$0.11 a share.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau 604-664-7314</p>
</text>
